@startuml
[*] --> StartupCheck
StartupCheck --> Ready : everything is fine
StartupCheck --> Stopped : problem during startup
Ready --> UserReset
Ready --> UserActivate
Ready --> UserTurnOff
UserReset --> Ready
UserActivate --> Monitoring
UserTurnOff --> Ready
Monitoring --> AlarmTriggered
Monitoring --> FalseAlarm
Monitoring --> TimeEnds
AlarmTriggered --> Monitoring
FalseAlarm --> Monitoring
TimeEnds --> Monitoring
Monitoring --> Stopped : user enters password
Stopped --> [*] : Completion
@enduml
